{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "product": "Toggle Concepts: a creative department by subscription, from Toggle, the motion design studio. Senior creatives own each ad concept: the idea, the branding and the art direction. Our engine builds every version of it in formats, sizes, languages, hooks and calls to action. Experts check every file before delivery. Clients pay per concept; every version is included. Plans: Starter (2 concepts a month), Growth (4), Scale (6).",
  "objective": "Sign-ups: the viewer starts a test month by booking the first call on concepts.toggle.studio.",
  "audience": "Main: marketing, performance and brand leads at growing digital brands that run paid ads every month (apps, e-commerce, fintech, gaming); they need many fresh ad versions to keep tests running and struggle to keep the look consistent. Second: creative and performance agencies that need extra production capacity, white-label, inside their own pipeline.",
  "markets": "United Kingdom, European Union (English-language campaigns), United States",
  "ownerName": "Roman",
  "ownerEmail": "kholodenko.r@gmail.com",
  "offer": "20% off your first month",
  "cta": "Start a test month",
  "destination": "https://concepts.toggle.studio",
  "deadline": "",
  "timeZone": "Europe/Belgrade",
  "immutables": "The names Toggle and Toggle Concepts and their logos exactly as supplied. The glossy orange ring always upright, never tilted, spun, recolored or carrying text. The offer \"20% off your first month\" word for word. Only real Toggle work, real screens and the real team: no invented interfaces, numbers or testimonials.",
  "synthesis": "Allowed: backgrounds and environments; abstract shapes and light. Not allowed: synthetic people, interfaces or work samples.",
  "variationNotes": "Hooks: hook-30-versions: one ad turns into 30 versions in three seconds, open on the engine swapping formats, languages and hooks | hook-ad-400: \"Ad #400. Still your brand.\", a wall of versions that all look like one brand | hook-5-days: \"Brief today. First files in 5 days.\", a five-day bar filling up, ending on finished files | hook-pay-concepts: \"Pay for concepts. Every version is included.\", one idea card multiplying into a grid of ads | hook-studio-1, hook-studio-2: written by the studio. Sequences: beats-engine: one concept, the engine builds every version (formats, languages, hooks), experts check, end card with the offer | beats-founder: the founder says in one line why Toggle made Concepts (founder film), then the engine demo, end card. Calls to action: Start a test month (main, full matrix) / Get 20% off your first month / See how it works (9:16 and 4:5, 15 s, two best hooks after review). Notes: build from real material (engine demo and landing on concepts.toggle.studio, founder film, Toggle reel). The engine demo shows a fictional brand (KITE); never present it as a client. Ring upright, once per frame. Inter Tight and brand book colors only. Captions always on.",
